    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Gridbreakers.</em></p><p><strong>“Everything broken still remembers how it worked.”</strong></p><p>Gridbreakers treat dead cities like sleeping machines. They know how to pry power from broken substations, wake lights in abandoned towers, and make a ruin choose sides. Where others see debris, they see leverage.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Investigation and the Tinkering aptitude.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Economy OPs.</li></ul>",
